  - education
abstract: A deterministic, point-weighted benchmark toolkit for Chinese Gaokao objective questions. The software provides scoring, harness, review, materialisation, and release-gate workflows. A companion 0.0.1 dataset contains 74 choice and fill-in mathematics questions from five 2025 papers, with four vision-required items and a fixed 353-point objective denominator. The dataset is distributed separately; exam material is not part of the software artifact and is not relicensed by these terms.

